    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104945" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐήραρχ-ος</span></b>  (proparox.), ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>captain of a
				trireme,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				837
			</span></i> (troch.), <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.70
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				1.1.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				773.5
			</span></i> (Ios, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1631.343
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				884.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii/ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
